# Reading up through a long conversation of Markdown answers with code, tables
# and folded work: each wheel jumps past the rows already laid out, and the
# screenshots taken right after show whether those rows have their content.
# Earlier turns load on request; the minimap's first mark is the oldest loaded
# question. A profile taken while this runs (`sample <pid>`) shows the cost of
# binding rows as they come into view.
fixture /reading-conversation/reading-history
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Reading conversation*" 20000
expect "Answer 35 ends here." 20000
screenshot latest
scroll この会話 -120
screenshot up-1
scroll この会話 -120
screenshot up-2
scroll この会話 -120
screenshot up-3
scroll この会話 -300
screenshot up-4
scroll この会話 -600
screenshot top
press 以前のターンを読み込む
expect "この発言へ移動: Reading question 24" 20000
screenshot earlier
